                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Half-Life co-op mod. Allows to play trough the original game, the Gearbox expansions, and loads of custom community-made maps with friends.\n\nThere's quite a lot of content, overall, tons of new to vanilla HL guns, quite some custom character models, and a crapton of maps. Everything comes pre-packaged, apart from Gearbox expansions requiring to own them. Community-made maps include classics like They Hunger.\n\nIf you and your friends appreciate older shooters, you will definitely appreciate playing Sven together. And it's free!",
